{
<tab><cl=F0F010>WHERE TO START?<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>First of all, you should understand the <l="hts:\\language\i_mainp.hts">management of the game<\l>, i.e. learn how to move, switch between general and combat modes, manipulate objects, put them in <l="hts:\\language\inventory.hts">inventory<\l>, and also communicate with other players.<br>
<tab>Then it is worthwhile to understand the current <l="hts:\\language\i_charact.hts">characteristics of<\l> your character and decide which path is closest to you: a warrior or a magician. Having chosen the path of a warrior, you will have to learn how to get yourself new weapons and armor, study the appropriate mantras, monitor the health of your character, develop physical characteristics, and complete missions to increase the title. Having embarked on the path of a magician, it is necessary to master and study alchemy, search for and create recipes for new compounds yourself, learn magic mantras, perform missions to increase the degree, developing your magical specialization.<br>
}